Title: I'm Yours
Artist: Jason Mraz
Key: B major
Tempo: 150
Time: 4/4

# B F# G#m E, two bars to a chord, all the way through — the intro, both verses
# and every chorus are the same eight bars. 150 bpm is the song's own tempo and
# not a doubled reading of 75: the cycle measures 12.7 s on the recording
# (bench/inspect_song.py, bar 4 → bar 12), which is eight bars at 150.
#
# The middle eight is the one place the harmony moves: it runs at *one* bar a
# chord and reaches the II (C#), which is the only chord in the song outside the
# four above.
#
# Note: verse and chorus are harmonically identical here, so their boundary is a
# lyric fact rather than a harmonic one.

